            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Government (Mr. Stewart), according to Government (Mr. Stewart), petitioner argued that for consent to be valid, the waiver must bear a reasonable relationship to the fact that the individual is on probation."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Government",
          "citations": [
